Subject: [PATCH] feat(footer): halftone HIMAWAN wordmark with a DAW playhead

Replace the tangle band with a giant halftone HIMAWAN cropped by the page's
bottom edge, an ADITYA kicker above it, a sweeping playhead with a bar/beat
readout, pointer-parted dots and click shock rings. Height and kicker position
are derived from the measured word.
